    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="ch7">

                <pb facs="0059" n="51" xml:id="pg51"/>

                <head>Status of intergovernmental debts owed the United States by reason of the
                    First World War<anchor n="1" xml:id="ch7-f1"/></head>
                <p>[For exchanges of correspondence in connection with amounts due the United States
                    under arrangements effected by the World War Foreign Debt Commission, see
                    Department of State, <hi rendition="#italic">Press Releases</hi>, volume XX
                    (January 7–June 24, 1939), and Department of State <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bulletin</hi>, volume I (July 1–December 30, 1939), as follows: <list>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Austria:</hi> January 28, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg53">page 53</ref>. (See also this volume, <ref
                                target="#pg559">pages 559</ref> ff.)</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Belgium:</hi> June 17, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg520">page 520</ref>; December 16, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg694">page 694</ref>.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Czechoslovakia:</hi> May 20, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg427">page 427</ref>; December 9, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg657">page 657</ref>.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Estonia:</hi> June 10, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg504">page 504</ref>; December 16, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg689">page 689</ref>.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Finland:</hi> June 10, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg505">page 505</ref>; December 16, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg689">page 689</ref>.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">France:</hi> June 17, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg521">page 521</ref>; December 16, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg690">page 690</ref>.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Hungary:</hi> June 17, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg516">page 516</ref>; December 16, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg687">page 687</ref>; December 23, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg713">page 713</ref>.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Italy:</hi> June 17, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg522">page 522</ref>; December 16, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg691">page 691</ref>.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Latvia:</hi> June 17, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg519">page 519</ref>; December 16, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg692">page 692</ref>.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Lithuania:</hi> June 10, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg506">page 506</ref>; December 9, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg658">page 658</ref>.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Poland:</hi> June 17, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg523">page 523</ref>; December 16, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg687">page 687</ref>.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Rumania:</hi> May 6, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg382">page 382</ref>; June 17, 1939, <ref target="#pg518"
                                >page 518</ref>; December 16, 1939, <ref target="#pg693">page
                                693</ref>.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Great Britain</hi>): May 27, 1939, <ref target="#pg453">page
                                453</ref>; December 16, 1939, <ref target="#pg695">page
                            695</ref>.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Yugoslavia:</hi> June 17, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg516">page 516</ref>; December 16, 1939, <ref
                                target="#pg688">page 688</ref>.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>Certain portions of the above intergovernmental correspondence are also printed
                    in the <hi rendition="#italic">Annual Report of the Secretary of the Treasury on
                        the State of the Finances for the Fiscal Tear Ended June 30, 1939</hi>
                    (Washington, Government Printing Office, 1940), pages 288 ff., and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, 1940, pages 544 ff.; see also <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, 1939, pages 68 ff. and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, 1940, pages 187 ff., “Obligations of Foreign
                    Governments.”]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
